  "notes": "{許可|きょか} means official permission or authorization to do something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{許可|きょか}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {許可|きょか}を{取|と}る: to obtain permission\n- {許可|きょか}を{得|え}る: to receive permission\n- {許可|きょか}する: to permit, grant permission\n- {許可|きょか}なく: without permission\n- {許可|きょか}を{求|もと}める: to request permission\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {入場|にゅうじょう}{許可|きょか}: admission permission\n- {営業|えいぎょう}{許可|きょか}: business license\n- {撮影|さつえい}{許可|きょか}: photography permission\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}{許可|きょか}: export license\n- {建築|けんちく}{許可|きょか}: building permit\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {許可|きょか}: official permission (formal)\n- {許|ゆる}し: forgiveness, personal permission (less formal)\n- {承認|しょうにん}: approval (often for documents/plans)",
